+## Table of contents
+
+Every page gets a table of contents built from its `##` and `###` headings, in document order, each entry linking to the heading's id; `###` entries are nested under the preceding `##`. It is rendered by `renderToc` (`src/markdown/toc.ts`) and exposed to layouts as `{{{toc}}}` (the default layout puts it above the content). Pages without `##`/`###` headings get no table of contents, and `toc: false` in the front matter turns it off for one page.
